/strong>Breescape Adjustable All-Season Comforter redefines all-season bedding with an innovative dual-layer design for customizable warmth. Its cooling layer and midweight layer work together to regulate sleep temperature on cold nights.&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>2-In-1 Design:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Light Cooling Layer: <\/strong>Ideal for summer. Patented BlendTek™ cooling fabric delivers an instant cool-to-the-touch feel, paired with breathable, soft Eco-Cosy® fabric and silk & down-like fill for lightweight comfort.<\/li><li><strong>Midweight Warm Layer: <\/strong>Ideal for spring & fall. Soft Eco-Cosy® fabric, ultra-soft 100% washed cotton, and lofty fill create air space to help trap warmth while maintaining breathable comfort.<\/li><li><strong>Combined Comforter:<\/strong> Ideal for winter. Zip both layers together for extra warmth on cold winter nights.<\/li><li><strong>Hidden 3-Sided Zipper: <\/strong>A concealed zipper design for a clean look and setup in seconds.<\/li><li><strong>Safe & Skin-Friendly:<\/strong> Every item bearing the OEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100 label is certified as having passed safety tests for harmful substances.<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","liquid":"<p class=\"product__sku\" id=\"Sku-{{ section.id }}-{{ product.id }}\" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>SKU:&nbsp;{{- product.selected_or_first_available_variant.sku -}}\n<\/p>\n<style>\n  .details__content ul {\n    margin-block: var(--sp-2);\n  }\n<\/style>","text_size":"text-base"}},"liquid_tmWqTz":{"type":"liquid","disabled":true,"settings":{"liquid":"{%- liquid\nassign cert_page_handle = 'third-party-tested'\nassign cert_page = pages[cert_page_handle]\nassign cert_modal_id = 'xo__third-party-tested'\nassign cert_trigger_id = 'xo__third-party-tested-trigger'\n-%}\n\n<div class=\"xo__third-party-tested w-full bg-zinc-100\">\n  <a\n    type=\"button\"\n    class=\"link inline-block size-style cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between\"\n    role=\"link\"\n    is=\"hover-link\"\n    aria-co